  "assessment": [
    "The actual cannot-suspend grant does not prevent the chosen unsuspend; only suspended-to-unsuspended Digimon change generates the relevant reaction group.",
    "Event matching distinguishes suspension/unsuspension, actor ownership, Digimon/Tamer type, self references and timing. A Rinas/BT12 and unrelated inherited sources do not receive this B singleton event.",
    "BT11 Rina memory effect has its exact per-copy/incarnation current-turn OPT; both EX13 Rina effects have no invented OPT and expose optional payment booleans before drawing.",
    "Successful self-suspension is required before Draw and After. Drawn card reaches actual own hand before route choices; a deeper same-source pending continuation preserves priority over original simultaneous siblings. Declining or failing payment creates no After processing.",
    "Continuation validates private active pending record/source incarnation, paid source/instance and completed draw. Trusted evolution uses only fixed reduction2 and bypasses ordinary Main/positive-memory guards solely inside that bound effect.",
    "The current first paid branch exposes newly drawn EX13-023 plus existing BT11-032 routes. Unsupported real When Digivolving route selection is an atomic precise HALT rather than hidden decline or skipped effect.",
    "Runner adapter uses boolean pre-draw options and current own-hand post-draw route choices; hidden deck order is not included in the pre-draw choice schema.",
    "Actual segment06 records unsuspend, mandatory −3to−2 memory, two explicit EX13 self-suspension declines, then actual B completion to A turn7/memory2. Grant audit confirms current Bturn6 cannot-suspend persists through pending resolution and expires only completed boundary; B-owned keywords lasting Aturn7 remain."
  ],
